Z||000000||Mattyman||10-12-2001||11:08 PM||||Ok, well I dont know what it is, but they must be giving Mustangs away for free or something.  They are everywhere.  I never really did like the mustangs especially in the 80's and early 90's, ugghh, and i dont think the new ones are great, they are ok sedans though.  Most of the time i see old retired men and women driving them, i guess the figured that it had a close enough resemblence to their long loved Buicks, which always seem to be white.  Get this, today i passed a white stang conv. and there was an old guy driving it with his wife asleep in the passengers seat. Upon passing him i noticed his HUGE hood ornimant it was a big pony, it stuck over the front end.hahaha  It would be nice to just drive down the road and see some Fiero's.  It makes me all happy inside seeing one go down the road.  People should trade in their plain-jane cars and find some fieros or restore one.  Sorry for the length||||reg||8
