glad you enjoy your Mustang 7Fieros, may you have happy rides  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> everyone has there likes and dislikes on cars.<P>BlackStang, if you want to make friends here, just remember people do know about cars and what they can do and can't do on this forum. Facts too, not just opinions. So I would be careful on what you say so you don't make anymore incidents arrise like this one where flaming and fights flare up between people. Right now, your not really being really friendly to the general public on this forum. Another thing, if alls you have to talk about it Mustangs, I reccomend you join a Mustang board to discuss your Mustang things, you will probably find a lot of people there with your same facts and outlook on Mustangs in general. Also remember when you look down on a Fiero here, you make 99.9% of the forum population feel bad. Try not to let these things happen again. There is always gonna be two sides to an opinion, but there can only be 1 fact.<P>Sorry everyone that this was long, but needed to get it off my chest.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Kyle - 85 GT<p>[This message has been edited by FieroKyle (edited 10-15-2001).]||||reg||1
